entries.rawResponseRequired:
The delivered question plus:
- tableEvidence[{i, j, dx, dy, rate}] — i and j index normalizeRows(source.rows) in authored order
- studentSlope
- rateConclusion
- generalForm{m, b, equation}
- factoredForm{a, c, equation}
- graphConstruction.points (at most 2 [x,y])
- meaningAssignments{rate | yIntercept | zero : {unit, contextMeaning, mathRole}}
Nothing else changes the verdict. stageChecks, selectedRows, the staging Δx/Δy/rate fields and activeHighlight only gate buttons or emphasis.

verifications.method:
Traced the code path from the board's submit through the client grading pipeline to server ingestion, reading each step with file:line references. Then ran the real modules in node from /tmp/claude-0/-home-user-mathmaster-platform/0c9f6d98-8c07-573e-9b95-e6a7539b670d/scratchpad/verify-4/repro.mjs and short.mjs:
- scored blank responses with scoreRepresentationBridge / scoreLinearMultipleRepresentations for every source kind (standardForm, slopeIntercept, pointSlope, twoPoints, table, plus one with context fields);
- built the parts list and partialCreditPercent exactly as LinearMultipleRepresentationsBoard.doSubmit and QuestionEngine.handleMissingToolAction do;
- passed them through the real recordQuestionAttempt, getQuestionCredit, serverCanRegradeEnvelope and sanitizeClientAttemptRecord (functions/shared/attemptPolicy.mjs, functions/shared/submissionIngestion.mjs);
- checked that shorter requiredCards boards pass validateRepresentationBridgeQuestion and validateToolQuestion.
No repository files were edited.
